Subject: [PATCH] FORK-20, part 4: the graph widget of mod screens

A line graph (graph: x, y, w, h, series of a value and a colour, samples, min_scale, tooltip) for Mekanism's GuiDoubleGraph (the fission and fusion reactors' heating): the client keeps the last samples readings of each series, one a tick while the screen is open, and draws them from oldest (left) to newest (right) on a scale from the least to the greatest reading kept, at least min_scale tall.

